$ MASS SOURCE
  MASSSOURCE  "MsSrc1"    INCLUDEELEMENTS "Yes"    INCLUDEADDEDMASS "Yes"    INCLUDELOADS "No"    INCLUDEMOVE "No"    INCLUDELATERALMASS "Yes"    INCLUDEVERTICALMASS "No"    LUMPATSTORIES "Yes"  
  MASSSOURCE  "MsWind"    INCLUDEELEMENTS "No"    INCLUDEADDEDMASS "No"    INCLUDELOADS "Yes"    INCLUDEMOVE "No"    INCLUDELATERALMASS "Yes"    INCLUDEVERTICALMASS "No"    LUMPATSTORIES "Yes"  
